{"id":"4024035776455594927","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"今年選舉適逢感恩節假期根本天意▓\n決定回趟台中當易燃物賴打並平衡一下我家票倉\n謝謝松山機場還屹立不搖我才能從羽田直飛\n\n民主自由得來不易\n改變要從你我做起\n台中是我的家\n我相信它值得1位更好的市長☝️\n\n11/28 投票日剛好碰上不少演唱會\n呼籲大家當日別忘記先投下自己神聖的一票 🙂\n生活即政治，追星也不例外\n▓ ▓▓▓▓▓▓","username":"everydaywefight_","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@everydaywefight_/post/DfYPzfrGVOv","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:47:47Z","media_type":"IMAGE","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-06T05:55:39.27308508Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-06T05:56:04.352701Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-06T05:56:04.352701Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_3230ead31d083eec","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4024047100262254467","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"They don’t want to watch the concert, they just want others people to know that they went to the concert. They only like the idea of it, but they don’t actually want it.","username":"daosfiq","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@daosfiq/post/DfYSYRykoeD","timestamp":"2026-11-06T00:10:17Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","is_reply":true,"relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-06T05:55:58.254090439Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-06T05:56:04.352701Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-06T05:56:04.352701Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_6af86124aaaedc04","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4024048788771677352","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"度過了很幸福的一天！💜\n\n特地跑了好多地方打卡，每一站都好喜歡，也能感受到大家為了防彈準備的滿滿心意。\n\n更意外的是，打卡途中還遇到了其他阿米！對方不只很熱情地跟我聊天，還邀請我演唱會四天都可以去找他領應援物。\n\n當下真的覺得好感動，明明只是因為喜歡同一個團體而相遇，卻能收到這麼溫暖的善意。\n\n但我真的是個大 I 人……雖然真的很想領應援，也很期待演唱會，但想到當天要自己去找人，突然又開始擔心自己到底有沒有勇氣踏出那一步哈哈哈哈哈。\n塞我應援😋🫰🏻\n\n能因為 BTS 遇見這麼多溫柔的人，真的覺得喜歡他們是一件很幸福的事。💜","username":"chyizn__","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@chyizn__/post/DfYSw2Vk6So","timestamp":"2026-11-06T00:13:38Z","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-06T05:55:39.273122417Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-06T05:56:04.352701Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-06T05:56:04.352701Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_8c38cc0416b5043f","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4024057118784769594","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"過了一週就快把演唱會忘光光\n但只有這個瞬間的畫面有用眼睛記起來\n當光只打在他身上又卡點舉手接著進到副歌的時候\n就覺得一切順的嚴絲合縫到雞皮疙瘩\n（但忘了是哪一首歌😭😭）\n.\n下次一起去能跳的地方繼續嗨ㄅ😭☝️","username":"mi_tingting27","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@mi_tingting27/post/DfYUqERDE46","timestamp":"2026-11-06T00:30:11Z","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-06T05:55:39.273171261Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-06T05:56:04.352701Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-06T05:56:04.352701Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_edeb99c2a27cf09f","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
