{"id":"4024095700492946184","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"不小心打開Netflix\n看到風哥2024在日產的演唱會\n不看還好…現在直接走不出來\n還有好多跳舞和彈琴的風哥\n\n分享我的入坑曲「満ちてゆく」\n這個版本真的看哭▓\n風哥還拿下手機拍下滿場的星海\n\n風哥說：一切最終都會好起來的\n保持樂觀 善良✨\n怎麼可以有這麼自由又溫暖的人啦🥹","username":"_.uck21","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@_.uck21/post/DfYdbgSDwsI","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:46:51Z","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-06T05:55:39.273165963Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-06T05:56:04.352701Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-06T05:56:04.352701Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_8c26cb2e82f55823","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
