{"id":"4024122250806625177","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"A massive shoutout to the main characters at Bukit Jalil last night who bought SEATED section tickets just to stand up and block 10 rows behind them for 2.5 hours straight.\n\nStanding Zone was right there on the site bro. But no, choose a chair, ignore it completely, and force a whole domino effect of misery on the entire section.\n\nPeople paid money to see The Weeknd, not pay RM600++ to watch the concert through your shoulder blades and your shaky iPhone 4K recording.","username":"ryanphang_","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@ryanphang_/post/DfYjd3MEwOZ","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:39:36Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-06T05:55:58.254050829Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-06T05:56:04.352701Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-06T05:56:04.352701Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_eb52d01e4236037c","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
