{"id":"4024167838814652560","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"It’s a concert, not a cinema. People go there to sing, dance, stand and enjoy the atmosphere. You can’t expect everyone to remain seated throughout the entire show.\n\nAnd have you looked at the people in front of you? There were plenty of others standing too. We weren’t the only ones. We only stood when people in front of us were standing as well. It’s not like we were deliberately standing while everyone else was seated.","username":"ailderynaa","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@ailderynaa/post/DfYt1QVGUiQ","timestamp":"2026-11-06T04:10:10Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","is_reply":true,"relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-06T05:55:58.254140124Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-06T05:56:04.352701Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-06T05:56:04.352701Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_d433e13c91688712","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
